{"articleNo":"495672","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=495672&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교내행사] 제525회 정기 TOEIC 시험 교내 시행 안내 (신청시 학번 입력 필수)","writer":"국제교류교육원","writeDate":"2024.08.12","hit":"3669","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><pre style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; overflow: auto; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); text-wrap: wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; line-height: 1.625rem; word-break: keep-all;\"><p class=\"a\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><b>국립금오공과대학교 국제교류교육원에서 한국<span lang=\"EN-US\">TOEIC</span>위원회와 협의를 통해</b></p><p class=\"a\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><b>국립금오공과대학교 재학생의 정기&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-US\">TOEIC&nbsp;</span>시험 응시 편의를 제공하고자&nbsp;</b></p><p class=\"a\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><b>아래와 같이 교내에서 정기&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-US\">TOEIC&nbsp;</span>시험을 개최하게 되어 안내드리오니 학생들의 많은 참여 바랍니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></b></p><p class=\"a\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"a\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"color: windowtext; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">■</span><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\">제525회 정기 TOEIC 시험 (2024년 9월 29일(일요일) 오전 진행)</font></p><p class=\"a\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></font></p><p class=\"a\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\">1. 일반접수기간: 2024.8.12(월) 오전10시 ~ 2024.9.16(월) 오전10시 응시료: 52,500원</font></p><p class=\"a\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;특별추가접수기간: 2024.9.18(수) 오전10시 ~ 2024.9.26(목) 낮12시 응시료: 57,700원</font></p><p class=\"a\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></font></p><p class=\"a\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: windowtext;\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: windowtext;\">고사장<span lang=\"EN-US\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">국립금오공과대학교 국제교육관 2층</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;/&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"color: windowtext;\">총 응시 가능 인원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: windowtext;\">: 100</span><span style=\"color: windowtext;\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: windowtext;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"a\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"color: windowtext;\">※ 응시 인원이&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: windowtext;\">20</span><span style=\"color: windowtext;\">명 미만인 경우&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-US\">TOEIC</span>시험이 자동 취소되며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: windowtext;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: windowtext;\">응시한 학생에게 개별 통보 예정<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"a\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"color: windowtext;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"a\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: windowtext;\">3.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: windowtext;\">결제방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: windowtext;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: windowtext;\">수험자가 직접 개별결제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: windowtext;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"a\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"color: windowtext;\">:&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">★★<span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">신청 시</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">&nbsp;학번 입력 필수!★★</span></span></span></p><p class=\"a\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"color: windowtext;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><br></span></span></span></p><p class=\"a\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">4.&nbsp;</span>환불규정<span lang=\"EN-US\">:&nbsp;</span>일반접수 및 특별추가접수 수험자는 토익홈페이지<span lang=\"EN-US\">(www.toeic.co.kr)</span>에 있는 환불률과 같은 환불률을 적용받습니다.</p><p class=\"a\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p class=\"a\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"></p><p class=\"a\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">※<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">시험 접수시 반드시 학번 입력 필수!★</span></span></span></span><br></p><p class=\"a\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\">※취소진행은 모두 수험자 개인이 해야 합니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"a\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\">※시험당일 반드시 규정신분증<span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span>수험표상 규정신분증 참조<span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span>을 지참하여야 합니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">. (</span><span style=\"color: red;\">학생증 절대 불가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"a\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\">※시험당일 오전&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-US\">9</span>시&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-US\">20</span>분까지 입실을 부탁드립니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">. (</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: red;\">9</span><span style=\"color: red;\">시&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-US\">50</span>분 이후 절대 입실 불가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">)<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"a\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\">※시험당일 필기도구는 지우개로 지울 수 있는 연필 또는 샤프 펜슬 가능<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;(</span><span style=\"color: red;\">볼펜<span lang=\"EN-US\">,&nbsp;</span>사인펜 금지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">)<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"a\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\">※아래의<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;URL</span>을 통해서만 국립금오공과대학교 국제교육관 응시 가능!<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"a\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p class=\"a\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\">■신청&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-US\">URL :</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; color: black; background: rgb(225, 240, 240);\">https://exam.toeic.co.kr/common/cert/comp/groupLink.php?comp_type=kumoh&amp;groupExam=kumoh_TOE_2</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; color: black; background: rgb(225, 240, 240);\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; color: black; background: rgb(225, 240, 240);\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmBYHoQDkh5AdgJwEo